Package: geoscales
Title: Nested Regions and Spatial Hierarchies for Modeling
Version: 0.7.0
URL: https://optimal2050.github.io/geoscales/r/,
    https://optimal2050.github.io/geoscales/,
    https://github.com/optimal2050/geoscales
BugReports: https://github.com/optimal2050/geoscales/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Oleg",
           family = "Lugovoy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "olugovoy@optimalsolution.dev",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5546-9875"))
Description: Provides discrete spatial representations for optimization and
    simulation models. A geoscale records atomic regions and their membership
    in nested or cross-cutting geoframes, with optional geometry and multiple
    weights. Joins region labels to tabular data and recasts values between
    spatial resolutions using explicit aggregation and disaggregation rules.
    Supports sampling, coarsening and telescoping zooms, with optional
    integration with 'sf' and 'rnaturalearth' for geometry, maps and
    coordinate-to-region matching; no boundary data are bundled. Extends
    'nestedscales' with spatial semantics.
